        "title": {
          "zh": "第一幕 · 不到25岁",
          "en": "Not yet 25"
        },
        "text": {
          "zh": "这是修拉的第一幅大型作品，画的时候他还不到25岁。他想用这幅巨大的画，在1884年春天的官方沙龙上一鸣惊人。",
          "en": "This was Seurat's first major composition, painted before he turned 25. He meant this huge canvas to make his mark at the official Salon in spring 1884."
        }
      },
      {
        "title": {
          "zh": "第二幕 · 被拒绝",
          "en": "Rejected"
        },
        "text": {
          "zh": "沙龙拒绝了它。修拉把它送到了新成立的独立艺术家沙龙展出。",
          "en": "The Salon rejected it. Seurat showed it instead at the newly formed Salon des Artistes Indépendants."
        }
      },
      {
        "title": {
          "zh": "第三幕 · 来到伦敦",
          "en": "In London"
        },
        "text": {
          "zh": "1924年，伦敦国家美术馆用考陶尔德基金买下了这幅画。今天，它在伦敦国家美术馆展出。",
          "en": "In 1924, the National Gallery bought the painting with the Courtauld Fund. Today it is on display at the National Gallery, London."
        }
      }
    ]
